        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Central Maine and Quebec Railway\n- Places: Rockland Railroad Station, Maine, Vermont, Quebec, New York\n- Topics: rail service, rail line leasing\n\nFacts:\n- The line serving Rockland Railroad Station has been leased to the Central Maine and Quebec Railway.\n- The Central Maine and Quebec Railway is planning to reintroduce service on that leased line.\n- The Central Maine & Quebec Railway, reporting mark CMQ, is a Class III freight railroad.\n- The Central Maine & Quebec Railway operates in the U.S. states of Maine and Vermont and in the Canadian province of Quebec.\n- The Central Maine & Quebec Railway is headquartered in New York, New York.",
